# KaziHub KE is split into two apps with separate environment files:
#
#   frontend/.env.example  → public browser values (NEXT_PUBLIC_*)
#   backend/.env.example   → server secrets, OAuth, session and CORS settings
#
# Root-level variables are not loaded by either app. Copy the examples into
# frontend/.env.local and backend/.env respectively, then fill in real values.
#
# Deployment steps, required production values and OAuth redirect URIs are in
# DEPLOYMENT.md.
